# A step that writes a place and reads it back: what `load` reads inside `refresh` is the file as `save` left it there,
# a value at a moment inside `refresh`, and the place keeps what `refresh` leaves, in the codomain (rule 4).

route cachecalc.main
step main/refresh
step main/refresh/save
step main/refresh/load

line entry > main call
line main/refresh/save > File(cache.json) own
line main/refresh/save > File(cache.json) in main/refresh value
line File(cache.json) in main/refresh > main/refresh/load value
line main/refresh/load > main/refresh back                # load's dict goes back to refresh
line main/refresh > main back                             # and refresh's to main, which prints it
line main > Screen own

home File(cache.json) in main/refresh main/refresh

side entry left
side File(cache.json) right
side Screen right
